NAME
       cut - select bytes or fields from each line

SYNOPSIS
       cut -b LIST | -c LIST | -f LIST [-d DELIM] [-s] [-n]
          [--complement] [--output-delimiter=STR] [file...]

DESCRIPTION
       LIST is N, N-, N-M or -M, separated by commas or
       blanks. Characters are bytes (there is no locale), so
       -c is -b.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

